# Root .dockerignore — legacy file, no longer used by any active build.
# Backend build context: ./ys-api  (uses ys-api/.dockerignore)
# Frontend build context: ./ys-web (uses ys-web/.dockerignore)
#
# Kept as a safety net in case someone accidentally builds from repo root.
*
!ys-api/
!ys-web/
ys-api/vendor/
ys-api/tests
ys-web/.next
**/.env
**/.env.*
